@startuml
title Task State Machine

state "PENDING" as pending
state "RUNNING" as running
state "RETRYING" as retrying
state "SUCCEEDED" as succeeded
state "FAILED" as failed

pending --> running : worker picks up message

running --> succeeded : task succeeds, write to Postgres
running --> retrying : transient failure
retrying --> running : retry with backoff
retrying --> failed : max retries exhausted

running --> running : worker crash\nredelivered\nre-run from start
succeeded --> succeeded : crash before ack\nidempotency check\nskip execution

succeeded --> [*] : done
failed --> [*] : done

@enduml